WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.794
It's Rouis!

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:04.462
The lead in Adler?

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.923
He's handsome both on and off stage.

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:30.113
His movements, his voice, his gaze.

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:34.951
Rouis must be aware of
what he's projecting every minute.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:38.455
He's just a year older,

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:42.042
but he's the star of our club
and holds power at school.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:44.627
What are you staring at?

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.798
Is being rude a wolf's habit?

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.011
You're the pup from the art department.

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:54.971
Perfect timing. I have a favor to ask.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.056
Follow me.

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:57.682
Okay.

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:07.275
This is just foolish.

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:08.526
I'll let you off the hook.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:10.779
You'll be protected
for the rest of your life.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.531
What are you staring at?

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:19.954
Showing your fangs to avoid a fight?

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.456
Excuse me.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:31.674
Still, you seem like you have
a good understanding.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.593
Come.

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:36.846
We're sneaking into the auditorium tonight
to give Zoe a rehearsal.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.015
But if the school finds out...

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.017
That's why I need you to keep watch.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:46.981
You're not going to refuse
and act like a hero, are you?

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.318
That's too bad.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.780
If I promised you to give you my leg,

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:57.200
you'd drool and accept my proposal,
wouldn't you?

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:00.995
You're a wolf.

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.207
Act like one and give yourself
some prestige.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.001
Who the hell are you?

00:02:08.002 --> 00:02:11.840
Just because you're bigger than me,
you thought you could beat me?

00:02:11.881 --> 00:02:13.007
Of course not.

00:02:13.758 --> 00:02:14.217
Oh, dear!

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.803
Being a carnivore is not so easy, is it?

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:21.641
So cool!

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:28.857
Personality doesn't always match power.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.527
Well, well, here is a star actor,

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:34.696
You must be busy,

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:37.657
since you're aiming for the next Beastar.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:45.206
Have you ever thought
about why we need a Beastar in this world?

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.085
Get over your jealousy
and get yourself straightened out.

00:02:49.752 --> 00:02:51.588
-Go wash your fangs with soap!
-Yeah!

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:52.755
Get lost!

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.382
Let's get outta here.

00:02:55.425 --> 00:02:57.802
That's enough. Let's go.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:02:59.220
Shut up!

00:03:01.764 --> 00:03:04.601
Everyone, please go back to your meal.

00:03:06.436 --> 00:03:09.689
Did I pay you back for last night?

00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:13.651
That...

00:03:13.735 --> 00:03:15.403
was nothing.

00:03:16.237 --> 00:03:18.740
Thank you very much, Rouis.

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:20.033
If you weren't--

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:24.704
You had to act like a loser, right?

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:31.920
How long will you fake your personality?

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:36.299
It seems like you're a worse wolf
than I thought.

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:42.180
In the end, I'm one of the preys.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.392
Excuse me.

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:51.272
-I...
-No matter how hard I try...

00:03:51.356 --> 00:03:52.899
I'll never be a predator.

00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:56.527
I've told you to knock.

00:03:57.362 --> 00:04:00.198
I'm sorry. I did, but you didn't answer.

00:04:00.865 --> 00:04:01.991
So I got worried.

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:03.785
What do you want?

00:04:05.036 --> 00:04:07.497
I wanted to do a final check
on tomorrow's lighting.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.458
That was you?

00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:15.296
During the rehearsal, I took more time
to lower the light for the last scene.

00:04:16.339 --> 00:04:17.382
I noticed.

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:18.967
Which was better for you?

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:22.095
Since it's the last scene,
I personally think

00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:26.140
we should emphasize the afterglow.

00:04:27.225 --> 00:04:28.393
Well, I don't know.

00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:31.521
You fidget a lot when you talk.

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.815
-Gosh.
-I'm sorry.

00:04:33.898 --> 00:04:36.067
I cut my claws often,

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.695
but they grow sharp again the next day.

00:04:39.529 --> 00:04:43.283
Are you saying you can't do anything
about your aggressive nature?

00:04:44.534 --> 00:04:46.494
That you're bothered by

00:04:47.078 --> 00:04:49.664
your undeniable aggressive nature?

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:55.169
I've always wanted to ask you this.

00:04:56.254 --> 00:04:59.507
Why don't you take responsibility
for your own strength?

00:05:00.049 --> 00:05:02.927
Show it to me,
rather than holding it back.

00:05:03.511 --> 00:05:06.472
Go ahead, show me your fangs.

00:05:07.765 --> 00:05:09.767
What are you saying, Rouis?

00:05:09.851 --> 00:05:13.354
It's against the law for a carnivore
to show his fangs to an herbivore--

00:05:13.438 --> 00:05:15.356
Don't just call me an herbivore!

00:05:16.941 --> 00:05:18.776
Don't be so sneaky.

00:05:19.402 --> 00:05:23.406
A large carnivore like you is
what I loathe the most.

00:05:24.574 --> 00:05:25.742
Stop acting cool

00:05:26.534 --> 00:05:28.870
and be real for once.

00:05:30.371 --> 00:05:32.206
Bite, Legoshi.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.458
Bite me!

00:05:40.965 --> 00:05:42.800
I'm... sorry.

00:05:47.472 --> 00:05:49.432
Sorry, I talked too much.

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.018
I'll come back later.

00:06:04.322 --> 00:06:05.823
It's warm...

00:06:07.116 --> 00:06:09.869
Don't challenge me again, okay?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.090
I am the hero.

00:06:22.215 --> 00:06:24.801
Let me finish you off in style!

00:06:37.855 --> 00:06:39.982
Looks like you are having so much fun.

00:06:43.444 --> 00:06:46.155
Sorry, but I need you to play a villain.

00:06:47.156 --> 00:06:49.117
I know who you really are!

00:06:52.829 --> 00:06:56.624
I'll show you who the real Reaper is.

00:06:57.959 --> 00:07:00.294
Legoshi, leave the rest to me.

00:07:00.378 --> 00:07:02.338
Don't let the audience see your back.

00:07:04.715 --> 00:07:06.467
Leave, if you are not determined.

00:07:28.573 --> 00:07:31.659
Don't worry. You are right.

00:07:33.202 --> 00:07:35.079
Rouis' skinny arm said to me,

00:07:37.206 --> 00:07:39.083
"Come on. Get up."

00:07:50.887 --> 00:07:52.638
The applause doesn't stop.

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:55.349
I wonder what they think

00:07:56.434 --> 00:07:57.477
about this performance.

